  "solution": "**Calculation:**\n\n(91+13 of (45div 21times 14÷5)-22times 4 )/((42times 21div 168times 2)-(66 of 15 div 90))\n\n= (91+13 of (15div 7times 14÷5)-22times 4 )/((42div 8times 2)-11)\n\n= (91+13 of 6-22times 4 )/(10.5-11)\n\n= (91+78 - 88)/((-0.5))\n\n= (169 - 88)/((-0.5))\n\n= -162\n\n**The value of (91+13 of (45div 21times 14÷5)-22times 4 )/((42times 21div 168times 2)-(66 of 15 div 90)) is -162.**",
